# AI agent modes and the harness > The envelope of an update run
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L115
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

# One whole attempt, and the steps that are part of it. An attempt is one
# process: it either ends in a commit or is rejected, and both endings are
# below — the same attempt, told twice.
whole::a Attempt an update ::e

pick::a Declare the mode ::e
  --> lock::a Take the write lock ::e
  --> clean::a Check the tree is clean ::e
  --> run::a Run the update mode ::e
  --> test::a Run the tests ::e
  --> after::a Commit the result ::e
  --> free::a Release the write lock ::e
pick, lock, clean, run, test, after, free --::P--> whole
